---
title: Overnight Oats
source: Matt
---

Combine @old fashioned oats{1/2%cup}, @cinnamon{1/8%tsp}, @chia seeds{1-1/2%tsp}, and @brown sugar{2%tsp} in a #jar{} or #bowl{}, then pour in @milk{1/2%cup}.

Mix well and refrigerate overnight.

> In the morning, adding a spoonful of honey or maple syrup makes it slightly sweeter.
